---

<Layout
  title="Upholstery Cleaning Westmount | Sofa and furniture cleaning"
  description="Upholstery, sofa, sectional, armchair and fabric furniture cleaning in Westmount. At-home service with a professional method adapted to delicate fabrics."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sofa, Sectional and Upholstery Cleaning in Westmount</h1>
      <p>
        In Westmount, living rooms and family spaces often center on sofas, sectionals and loveseats with fabrics that stay in plain view. Our
        <strong>upholstery cleaning in Westmount</strong> focuses on even, fabric-safe results for <strong>couch cleaning</strong>, armchairs and modular seating, with
        attention to delicate weaves and trim in refined residential interiors.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:5148939939">(514) 893-9939</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section svp-section-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <ServiceVideoProof
        title="See our upholstery cleaning in action"
        subtitle="Real example of in-home sofa cleaning"
        description="Watch a real job and see our professional method for cleaning upholstered furniture right in the client's home."
        youtubeId="auWtvSvqucg"
        youtubeTitle="Stained sofa cleaning in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        allVideosHref="/en/video-gallery/"
        videoAspectRatio="9 / 16"
        playLabel="Watch the video"
        allVideosLabel="See all our projects"
        closeLabel="Close video"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Local service in Westmount</h2>
      <p>
        We work in-home with a structured assessment: fiber type, seam lines and high-touch zones (headrests, arms, seat decks). That plan guides
        <strong>sofa cleaning in Westmount</strong> and <strong>sectional cleaning</strong> so we do not over-wet or over-agitate textiles that need a lighter touch.
      </p>
      <p>
        For our full range of fabric furniture options and add-ons, see our
        <a href="/en/services/meubles-tissu/">fabric upholstery cleaning service</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Why professional upholstery care matters here</h2>
      <p>
        Upholstery traps fine dust, allergens and body oils. <strong>Armchair cleaning</strong> and loveseat care matter as much as the main sofa when you want a
        consistent look across the room and fresher air in spaces used daily.
      </p>

      <h2>Our method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fabric inspection and compatibility checks before products touch the textile.</li>
        <li>Targeted pre-treatment of high-contact areas.</li>
        <li>Hot-water extraction steam cleaning with professional equipment.</li>
        <li>Floor and pathway protection during setup and service.</li>
        <li>Strong vacuum recovery for drying typically within 2 to 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture we clean</h2>
      <p>
        Sectionals, modular sofas, standard sofas, loveseats, recliners, upholstered dining chairs and ottomans — each piece receives
        <strong>upholstered furniture cleaning</strong> matched to its weave, soil level and use pattern.
      </p>

      <h2>Optional add-ons</h2>
      <p>
        Spot treatment, odor control or enzymatic passes when justified by the initial inspection; we recommend only what fits the actual condition of your furniture.
      </p>

      <h2>Why homeowners choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        Long-standing residential experience on the Island, eco-conscious product choices where appropriate, and disciplined execution from walk-through to final
        grooming of cushions and skirts.
      </p>

      <h2>Westmount FAQ</h2>
      <FAQSchema
        faqs={[
          {
            question: "Do you clean large sectionals in Westmount condos?",
            answer:
              "Yes, when building access and rules allow. We plan hose runs, elevator use and in-suite protection to work efficiently without marking common areas.",
          },
          {
            question: "Can you safely clean light or textured fabrics?",
            answer:
              "We select chemistry and agitation based on fiber identification; light and textured covers often need gentler cycles and controlled moisture.",
          },
          {
            question: "How long before we can use the furniture?",
            answer:
              "Usually a few hours, depending on fabric, airflow and indoor humidity; your technician gives a practical range after inspection.",
          },
        ]}
      />

      <h2>Request an estimate</h2>
      <p>
        For sofa, sectional, armchair or fabric furniture cleaning in Westmount, contact Empire Cleaning Group at (514) 893-9939.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
